# The thinking map of the codex AgentHarness (docs/adr/0040 §2, 0041 §1):
# what a role's THINKING (low|medium|high, plan §5) becomes. Read by
# adapters/codex/run.sh; a missing line is a refusal naming this file and
# the key.
#
# Codex 0.166.0: -c model_reasoning_effort=<level>, sent to the Responses
# API as reasoning.effort (verified against a scripted endpoint,
# 2026-11-04). The same three words; ADR 0040's ADK map sends OpenAI the
# same reasoning_effort values.
OPENAI_LOW=low
OPENAI_MEDIUM=medium
OPENAI_HIGH=high
